  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "acc244a24b1b7ea3",
      "translationZh": "开源推理生态系统已变得难以比较，因为这些项目的功能日益重叠，但所面向的工作负载仍然大不相同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fdf52a8495439027",
      "translationZh": "有些项目优先考虑可移植的本地推理，有些专注于 GPU 集群的吞吐量，还有一些将推理与模型管理或智能体执行相结合。我整理了这份比较，以明确每个项目的适用定位。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48c580f2c883c73e",
      "translationZh": "这不是一份基准测试排名。实际性能在很大程度上取决于模型、量化、提示词长度、批大小、后端和硬件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "961a302cffb86624",
      "translationZh": "推理引擎与服务栈",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8109edc9fc93b1be",
      "translationZh": "项目 主要技术栈 最适合的用途 硬件与平台 主要能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d2ea3d301689b59",
      "translationZh": "可移植的本地 GGUF 推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1941480ec69e9d8",
      "translationZh": "CPU、CUDA、Metal、Vulkan、HIP、SYCL 及其他后端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c47d283f8c29d887",
      "translationZh": "成熟的 GGUF 生态系统、广泛的量化支持、CPU/GPU 卸载、多模态模型、语法约束输出、推测解码、多 GPU 执行，以及兼容 OpenAI 的服务器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c47e8b1176a48441",
      "translationZh": "Go，采用原生推理后端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "160c3edf3e7cbffd",
      "translationZh": "简单的本地模型安装与应用集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a5ba23e3a9bca36",
      "translationZh": "Windows、macOS 和 Linux",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae53a7ce254a3439",
      "translationZh": "模型打包、下载、生命周期管理、本地 API，以及便捷的开发者体验",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f75d4b7c5f8fdcd2",
      "translationZh": "C#/.NET，采用托管和原生后端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "708f53a670b927f7",
      "translationZh": "将本地推理直接嵌入跨平台 .NET 应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3a569fe39518d03",
      "translationZh": "在 Windows、Linux、macOS 和 iOS 上使用 CPU、CUDA、Metal 和 Vulkan",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a073029c3fef654",
      "translationZh": "GGUF、稠密/MoE 和多模态架构、嵌入、媒体生成、分页和前缀共享 KV 缓存、连续批处理、推测解码、MTP、张量并行，以及兼容 OpenAI/Ollama 的 API",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf874eaca7f8b04a",
      "translationZh": "在 Apple Silicon 上进行本地推理和微调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7de1f8af7dfab94",
      "translationZh": "量化、提示缓存、推测解码、LoRA/微调和分布式 MLX 执行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78558be7b5ad53e4",
      "translationZh": "在浏览器、移动设备和异构硬件上进行编译式推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f144ba1ad695f41",
      "translationZh": "CUDA、Metal、Vulkan、WebGPU、浏览器和移动平台",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9bd3ec9cf46da4e",
      "translationZh": "提前编译、针对特定设备的优化、量化和原生/Web 部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9a387a2048ae279",
      "translationZh": "Python、PyTorch 和经过优化的加速器内核",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24a1e084f8675afc",
      "translationZh": "高吞吐量多用户服务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32ab0c9ebbe205f5",
      "translationZh": "主要为数据中心 GPU 和加速器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fff8e11be382d918",
      "translationZh": "连续批处理、PagedAttention、前缀缓存、推测解码、LoRA、结构化输出、多模态服务和分布式并行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d38e4eeb1211de0",
      "translationZh": "Python，配合经过优化的加速器运行时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a36386d766e95dcd",
      "translationZh": "大规模推理与共享前缀工作负载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0d4378e484c20e2",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA、AMD 及其他服务器加速器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a86cc23f585ccdfd",
      "translationZh": "RadixAttention、前缀感知调度、结构化生成、推测解码以及多 GPU/多节点服务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5c61c04de86d9d8",
      "translationZh": "高度优化的 NVIDIA 部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "732789929bdd89da",
      "translationZh": "TensorRT 编译、动态批处理、分页注意力、量化、KV 缓存复用、推测解码和分布式并行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af4ab2f97c0d8ffc",
      "translationZh": "Rust/Python，配合加速器后端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11932e0eddfe6fe5",
      "translationZh": "现有的 Hugging Face 服务部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7281bf690c0cb606",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA、AMD、Gaudi 及其他加速器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e09b3637f0e4eca",
      "translationZh": "连续批处理、张量并行、Flash/Paged Attention、流式输出、量化和生产环境遥测；目前处于维护模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e83a5e5334259df",
      "translationZh": "功能可用性因模型和后端而异。例如，项目层面支持推测解码、多模态或多 GPU，并不意味着每一种架构与设备组合都能获得同等支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d9403cdf7954fad7",
      "translationZh": "llama.cpp：当 GGUF 兼容性、可移植性和对消费级硬件的广泛支持是首要考量时，这是最强的通用选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d9a800b648c0f951",
      "translationZh": "Ollama：当便捷的模型安装和稳定的本地 API 比直接控制推理内部机制更重要时，这是一个方便的选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a8d43f8c34f22995",
      "translationZh": "TensorSharp：当本地推理、多模态处理或受限的智能体执行必须直接嵌入 C#/.NET 应用程序时，这是一个值得关注的选项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bf097a83bee99226",
      "translationZh": "MLX-LM：对于专门在 Apple Silicon 上进行推理或微调的 Python 用户而言，这是一个自然契合的选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "74015b6baab0c7e8",
      "translationZh": "MLC LLM：最适合跨浏览器、移动设备和异构 GPU API 的编译式部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb1855e2425eccba",
      "translationZh": "vLLM：在数据中心加速器上提供高吞吐量并发推理服务的强力选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "843dddf1a8b27ebb",
      "translationZh": "SGLang：对于推理模型、结构化生成以及大量复用前缀的工作负载，尤其具有吸引力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "961eb7c3d1d13742",
      "translationZh": "TensorRT-LLM：在 NVIDIA 硬件上最大限度提升性能的专门选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "217cea2d48588667",
      "translationZh": "TGI：随着新功能的积极开发放缓，如今它最适合现有的 Hugging Face 部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "45fa49d835dac171",
      "translationZh": "本地推理与面向服务器的推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abad61bd29e3c49b",
      "translationZh": "最重要的区别可能不在于单纯的每秒 token 数，而在于模型需要在哪里运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1751e34775faeae1",
      "translationZh": "对于单用户工作站、桌面应用程序或离线设备，llama.cpp、Ollama、TensorSharp、MLX-LM 和 MLC LLM 通常是更适合的一组工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bdcd663876f271c6",
      "translationZh": "对于加速器服务器上的大量并发用户，vLLM、SGLang 和 TensorRT-LLM 提供的调度和分布式功能很难在轻量级嵌入式运行时中复现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42e3c3be54cba1b9",
      "translationZh": "运行本地服务器与嵌入引擎之间也存在区别：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e1daabe6a7171e49",
      "translationZh": "Ollama 提供便捷的、单独管理的本地服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec10b03b2856511b",
      "translationZh": "llama.cpp 既可作为库使用，也可作为服务器使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "21f2e5fdedf504ba",
      "translationZh": "TensorSharp 旨在将张量、模型操作、缓存和调度直接开放给 .NET 应用程序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2b248090dbf61c71",
      "translationZh": "MLX-LM 在 Apple Silicon 上提供 Python 原生工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2f558f8c97e2d9e9",
      "translationZh": "MLC LLM 针对特定部署目标编译模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f372e5d1c2d677f9",
      "translationZh": "这些方法在安装、进程边界、可扩展性、启动时间和应用程序打包方面有不同的权衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7b991f5d2eba3942",
      "translationZh": "智能体和工具使用方面呢？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e109fe3aa97c17b4",
      "translationZh": "生成工具调用与安全地执行工具并不是一回事。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "190dcfc8b35a333d",
      "translationZh": "大多数推理引擎都可以生成结构化 JSON 或工具调用输出，但工作流状态、权限、文件访问、shell 执行和沙箱隔离通常由另一个层提供。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8aea11f47c9c5cb2",
      "translationZh": "常见组合包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1298ae2c34a40662",
      "translationZh": "llama.cpp 或 Ollama + 外部智能体框架，用于实现可移植的本地推理，并在应用层进行编排。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c15e6dab242ee981",
      "translationZh": "vLLM 或 SGLang + LangGraph、Microsoft Agent Framework 或其他运行时，用于高并发智能体服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d23a8de8ceb25213",
      "translationZh": "当 .NET 应用需要一个受限的本地工具调用循环，且包含技能、文件操作以及在沙箱中执行 shell 或代码的能力时，可使用 TensorSharp AgentHost。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "835fca9d2e800b0a",
      "translationZh": "MLX-LM 或 MLC LLM + 特定于应用的编排，用于面向设备的智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e300dfc5dcc41aaa",
      "translationZh": "对于要求严格、长时间运行的工作流，LangGraph 或 Microsoft Agent Framework 等专用运行时在持久化、检查点保存和多智能体编排方面，提供的能力远比推理引擎层面的工具循环全面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "58b894f63e9ebb85",
      "translationZh": "llama.cpp 仍然是本地 GGUF 推理的基准。其生态系统、硬件覆盖范围和社区规模，是较小的项目难以匹敌的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9e8f64d7955beeb9",
      "translationZh": "Ollama 解决的问题与 llama.cpp 不同。它侧重于安装、模型分发和 API 易用性，而不是开放引擎层面的每一项控制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3be270633eaaedf",
      "translationZh": "vLLM 和 SGLang 不一定能替代嵌入式本地引擎。它们主要面向模型服务工作负载，在这类场景中，批处理和加速器利用率占据主导地位。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "967749b0aa0f76dd",
      "translationZh": "Apple Silicon 现在有几条可靠的技术路线。llama.cpp、MLX-LM、MLC LLM 和 TensorSharp 各自在可移植性、Python 集成、编译和应用嵌入之间体现出不同的权衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "abb8f7124adbbe7a",
      "translationZh": "语言生态系统可能与速度同样重要。对于许多 ML 系统而言，Python 服务是自然的选择；而对于需要更紧密集成的 C++、Swift、Rust、Java 或 .NET 应用，原生库可能更合适。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b472696cf021ad32",
      "translationZh": "多模态支持需要更精确的比较。“多模态”可能指图像理解、音频输入、图像编辑、文本生成图像或视频生成，而这些能力不能相互替代。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fd52112e287e10a6",
      "translationZh": "基准测试数据需要结合背景来看。提示词长度、量化、缓存状态、批大小、并发度、采样设置和首个词元生成时间，都可能完全改变结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07fa437ca9da1ad5",
      "translationZh": "没有一种引擎在所有情况下都是最佳选择。正确的选择取决于工作负载是在本地还是在服务器端运行，是嵌入式还是基于服务，是对延迟敏感还是以吞吐量为导向，以及是要求可移植性还是针对特定加速器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c960103599a04976",
      "translationZh": "利益披露：我参与 TensorSharp 的开发，因此请将其条目视为项目维护者的介绍，而非独立评测。欢迎对任何一行提出更正。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79e41ba02c9f7d79",
      "translationZh": "你目前使用什么进行本地推理？这份比较还遗漏了哪些引擎或重要区别？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b853053f39deca92",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/fuzhongkai 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
